[h1]Mod Launcher and Code Injection Mods[/h1]
Translation support comes pre-installed with English, Japanese, Russian, and Chinese. Many thanks to fateash for the Chinese translation!
日本語対応: 翻訳機能は英語・日本語・ロシア語・中国語がプリインストールされています。
中文：内置简体中文翻译，感谢 fateash 提供翻译。
Русский язык: поддержка перевода предустановлена для английского, японского, русского и китайского языков.
Additional translations are welcome!

You must  [url=https://github.com/lucky-wolf/DW2-Mod-Launcher/releases]download it from GitHub[/url], Expand that Zip file [i]to any folder on your computer you want[/i] - such as:
[code]C:\Users\<you>\DW2ModLauncher[/code]
and then you must run the application in that folder:
[code]DW2ModLauncher.exe[/code]
[i](it will not have an extension if you're on linux)[/i]

You then should pin to your taskbar the icon, or right click on the exe file and make a shortcut on your desktop.

[list]
[*]NEVER RUN DW2 FROM STEAM AGAIN.
[*]ONLY RUN FROM THIS PROGRAM.
[/list]

⚠️ [b]The Steam Workshop Item is ONLY A STUB.  FOLLOW THE INSTRUCTIONS. [/b] ⚠️

